<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 338 FOR SIX AT LUNCH VS ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 338 FOR SIX AT LUNCH VS ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 338 for six wickets against England at lunch on the second day of the first test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings - (overnight 233 for five) S.Fleming 105 not out, C.Cairns 67; D.Cork two for 82.</p>
